<title>UK: BGB Finance Ireland sets 13.4 bln yen 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>BGB Finance Ireland sets 13.4 bln yen 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IBJ International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN GROUP</p>
<p> AMT    13.4 BLN YEN  COUPON     0.90 PCT  MATURITY    04.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.20     PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    UNLISTED  DENOMS (K)  100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/JPGOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
